    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29">

                <pb facs="0140" n="24" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg24"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 863.0011/9.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Penfield to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 28, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I regret to report assassination today at Sarajevo, Bosnia, of Archduke Franz
                    Ferdinand, heir apparent to the thrones of Austria-Hungary, and his wife, the
                    Duchess of Hohenberg, by pistol shots fired by a student. The Archduke and wife
                    were attending an official function. The Austrian Emperor returns to Vienna
                    Monday from Ischl.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Penfield</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
